WEBVTT

00:58:28.099 --> 00:58:30.795
and it feels overwhelming to most people.

00:58:30.819 --> 00:58:35.195
And our normal response is just
to either change the subject

00:58:35.219 --> 00:58:37.539
or to carry it, feel sick about it.

00:58:37.563 --> 00:58:40.234
And we actually get annoyed
with people who say,

00:58:40.258 --> 00:58:42.708
"You know, I think we might
be able to solve that."

00:58:42.732 --> 00:58:44.244
It's like, "Don't be so silly."

00:58:44.268 --> 00:58:46.895
And yet, if there is to be any hope,

00:58:46.919 --> 00:58:49.192
that's kind of the only thing
we can believe --

00:58:49.216 --> 00:58:51.317
like, it won't sort itself out.

00:58:51.341 --> 00:58:54.192
And so, I kind of love that mindset of,

00:58:55.240 --> 00:58:58.493
yeah, live with the problem
for a bit and then just say,

00:58:58.517 --> 00:59:01.560
"Well, what would it look like
if people were to figure it out?